  "description": "Reid Bikes ATB WSD | Women's mountain bike\nA straightforward, reliable mountain bike designed for everyday adventures on paths, trails and around town.\nThe Reid Bikes ATB WSD is a dependable mountain bike built for exploring different routes and tackling everyday rides. Its durable Hi-Tensile steel frame and straightforward components make it a practical choice for riders looking for a tough, easy-to-maintain bike.\nThe 26\" wheels and 1.95\" all-terrain tyres offer predictable handling across mixed surfaces, while the rigid steel fork and wide 680mm riser handlebars provide a stable, controlled riding position.\nA 3x7-speed drivetrain, featuring Shimano front and rear derailleurs, gives you a choice of 21 gears to help tackle hills and enjoy more comfortable riding on flatter routes. Alloy V-brakes provide reliable stopping power, while the MTB comfort saddle adds comfort on everyday rides.\nFinished in plum, the ATB WSD is a practical introduction to off-road riding, with a choice of frame sizes to help find the right fit.\nThe Reid Bikes ATB WSD is ideal for:\n\nEntry-level mountain bike riders, looking for a straightforward introduction to off-road cycling\n\nEveryday recreational riding, with a durable Hi-Tensile steel frame and practical components\n\nExploring paths and light trails, with 26\" wheels and 1.95\" all-terrain tyres\n\nRiders looking for versatile gearing, with a 3x7-speed drivetrain offering 21 gear options\n\nSimple, easy-to-maintain cycling, with a rigid steel fork and dependable alloy V-brakes\n\nComfortable everyday riding, with 680mm riser handlebars and an MTB comfort saddle\n\nRegular recreational use, with double-wall alloy rims and a sealed bottom bracket",
